{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"BusinessDetails\">Business Details</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business BusinessDetails Code Is On Print Settings To ToDate\">The <code>Business Details</code> form, located under the <code>Settings</code> tab, enables you to input information that will be displayed on your printed documents.</p><div class=\"flex pointer-events-none space-x-6 rtl:space-x-reverse items-center\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-cog text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Settings\">Settings</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><span class=\"rtl:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-right text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><span class=\"ltr:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-left text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><div class=\"border rounded inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"basis-72 flex items-center gap-2 p-4\"><i class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 fas fa-fw fa-info-square\"></i><span class=\"text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"BusinessDetails\">Business Details</span></span></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"\">The form includes the following fields:</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></summary><div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Business BusinessName Exactly Invoice Invoices Name On Other Port Reports\">Enter your business name exactly as it should appear on invoices, reports, and other documents.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Custom Customer Is Name Off Port Reports Sent To ToDate\">This name represents your company in all customer-facing materials and official reports.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business Businesses Empty Is Name To ToDate\">For business templates, leave this field empty to avoid copying the name when creating new businesses.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Address\">Address</span></summary><div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Add Address And Business Invoice Invoices Is On Statement\">Enter your complete business address for display on invoices, statements, and correspondence.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Add Address And Code Count Country Line Lines To ToDate\">Use multiple lines to format the address properly - typically street, city/state, postal code, and country.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Add Address And Business Custom Customer Is Off On To ToDate\">This address appears on all customer documents and should match your official business registration.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Country\">Country</span></summary><div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Count Country Port Reports Select Tax To ToDate\">Select your country to enable country-specific features, tax reports, and compliance documents.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Count Country Port Reports Tax To ToDate\">Choosing your country unlocks localized tax forms, VAT/GST reports, and regulatory requirements.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Calculation Currency Date DateFormat Is Method On Tax\">This setting affects date formats, currency defaults, and available tax calculation methods.</p></div></details><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business BusinessLogo By Code Image Logo On To ToDate\">You can set a business logo by uploading a file to the <code>Image</code> section.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Code Date On To ToDate Update\">To save the changes, click the <code>Update</code> button.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-900 p-8 text-sm\"><span class=\"border font-semibold rounded-md py-3 px-4 bg-[#5cb85c] border-[#4cae4c] text-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Update\">Update</span></span></div></div>",
  "key": "business-details-form"
}
